    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Contract Analyzer - Error Handler\n\nAdapted from the \"Section 2 - Error Handler\" pattern (n8n Academy, N8N103) —\nsame Error Trigger → format → notify shape, but repointed from the training\nendpoint to a Supabase `error_log` table so failures in the Contract Analyzer\nworkflow get captured automatically instead of silently failing.\n\n## Trigger\n- Error Trigger: fires when the linked workflow fails in a production execution\n  (not on manual test runs)\n\n## Data Captured\n- workflow.name / workflow.id\n- execution.url — direct link to the failed run for debugging\n- execution.error.message\n- execution.lastNodeExecuted — which node broke\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this workflow, reconnect the Supabase credential (must be the service role key — RLS is on with no policies), replace the project URL.\n2. Run supabase/schema.sql (creates the error_log table) if you haven't already.\n3. Publish/activate this workflow.\n4. Copy its workflow ID (URL bar) and paste it into Contract Analyzer's\n   Settings → Error Workflow field.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, 128],
      "id": "46716e8d-136e-4690-a70a-fa222b6e3684",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    }
  ],
